03:10.356 --> 03:11.316
Active voice.

03:11.399 --> 03:14.444
The object of the active voice becomes
the subject of the passive voice in

03:14.527 --> 03:15.445
pattern four.

03:15.528 --> 03:17.113
A pattern four sentence has two objects,

03:17.197 --> 03:19.490
so it can be written as
two passive sentences,

03:19.574 --> 03:21.075
with each object as the subject.

