It's One-O-One.

20:47.037 --> 20:48.121
It says One-O-Two.

20:52.334 --> 20:53.252
Dang it.

20:53.335 --> 20:54.253
Guess you're right.

20:57.339 --> 20:58.632
Hey bro, cup of water?

21:00.717 --> 21:02.135
Why should I?

21:02.636 --> 21:04.930
- We're in the same class, we're friends.
- You're being kind of rude. -Hey-

21:05.013 --> 21:07.432
Don't be so cheap.
I'm just asking for water.

21:07.516 --> 21:08.517
Right?

21:12.229 --> 21:13.522
If I get dehydrated and faint,

21:13.605 --> 21:15.107
you wanna be responsible for that?

21:16.108 --> 21:18.527
Don't be so mean, I just asked for water.

21:19.069 --> 21:20.362
But you're just standing there.

21:20.445 --> 21:22.406
I guess I'm gonna faint and die now.

21:24.449 --> 21:26.201
I'm even losing my voice.

21:41.800 --> 21:43.176
Who's the one being rude?

21:47.055 --> 21:47.931
Thanks, man.

21:48.015 --> 21:49.766
I'll buy you three waters tomorrow.

21:51.560 --> 21:52.644
Keep studying hard.

21:52.728 --> 21:53.312
Mm.

21:53.812 --> 21:54.896
See ya later.

21:56.940 --> 21:58.525
And listen to your mom.

21:59.860 --> 22:01.028
Am I doing this right?

22:17.127 --> 22:18.337
We have a new student.

22:19.338 --> 22:20.339
Please introduce yourself.

22:24.843 --> 22:25.427
Yes.

22:25.927 --> 22:26.887
Hello.

22:27.554 --> 22:28.764
I'm Oh Beom-seok, yeah.

22:29.473 --> 22:30.849
- Yay.
- Woo!

22:33.685 --> 22:34.519
Okay.

22:35.062 --> 22:36.980
Everyone, be nice to Beom-seok.

22:45.072 --> 22:45.697
Hey,

22:46.198 --> 22:47.407
- check him out.
- Should we?

22:48.200 --> 22:49.117
Let's go.

22:54.039 --> 22:54.873
Hi.

22:57.834 --> 22:58.752
Oh Beom-seok?

22:59.336 --> 23:00.170
Yes.

23:00.712 --> 23:01.797
Where did you transfer from?

23:02.881 --> 23:06.218
- I transferred from Mungang High School.
- Ooh.

23:06.301 --> 23:08.303
Ooh. Dude's got some money.

23:10.472 --> 23:12.015
So you must know Ji-won?

23:12.099 --> 23:13.600
I'm best friends with him.

23:15.560 --> 23:16.186
No,

23:16.686 --> 23:17.604
I don't know him.

23:18.397 --> 23:19.481
You don't know Ji-won?

23:20.732 --> 23:21.942
You don't know Han Ji-won?

23:23.902 --> 23:24.611
Um-

23:25.112 --> 23:27.948
I think I've heard of him,
but I really don't know him at all.

23:41.420 --> 23:42.421
Move it.

23:45.215 --> 23:46.133
That's my seat.

23:48.760 --> 23:49.678
No thanks.

23:58.728 --> 23:59.688
I said move.

24:03.692 --> 24:05.569
I am sick of your shit.

24:07.028 --> 24:07.737
Not now.

24:15.912 --> 24:18.373
Why have you all been so chatty lately?

24:18.457 --> 24:20.167
You won't even let your hyung sleep.

24:21.710 --> 24:22.961
Can I go back to sleep?

24:23.879 --> 24:24.713
Hm?

24:28.592 --> 24:29.301
Watch yourself.

24:52.532 --> 24:53.575
Everybody get one?

24:53.658 --> 24:54.910
- Hurry up!
- Let's get drunk!

24:54.993 --> 24:56.411
- Woo!
- Oh, yeah!

24:56.495 --> 24:57.787
- Wasted!
- Wasted!

25:00.916 --> 25:02.751
Yeong-bin, you're really not drinking?

25:02.834 --> 25:03.710
Again?

25:03.793 --> 25:06.254
- Why do you keep backing out?
- Next week is the mock

25:06.338 --> 25:07.547
test, you fucking idiots.

25:08.882 --> 25:11.885
Study hard and get a killer
job at a huge corporation.

25:14.054 --> 25:14.763
Yeong-bin-a.

25:15.263 --> 25:17.265
Yeon Si-eun's lost his fucking mind,
lately.

25:17.349 --> 25:18.975
Right? He's mouthing off.

25:19.059 --> 25:21.394
What the hell's he gonna do with a pen?
Dumbass.

25:21.478 --> 25:23.897
I mean even today when that
asshole glared at us,

25:23.980 --> 25:25.524
his eyes looked fucking crazy.

25:25.607 --> 25:28.068
- I almost killed him in front of everyone.
- Bullshit.

25:28.151 --> 25:30.111
- You were standing still.
- Bullshit, you asshole.

25:30.195 --> 25:31.530
I almost snapped his neck.

25:32.197 --> 25:34.324
What do you think I should
do with that guy?

25:34.908 --> 25:37.244
I keep messing with him,
but nothing's working.

25:38.286 --> 25:40.205
That fucking shithead's
soul just won't break.

25:40.705 --> 25:41.831
At all.

25:45.877 --> 25:46.795
College?

25:48.922 --> 25:51.216
Studying is the only thing
he ever cares about.

25:51.299 --> 25:52.175
We'd probably

25:52.259 --> 25:54.177
destroy his soul if we messed with that.

25:54.261 --> 25:55.220
It's all he does.

25:55.303 --> 25:56.721
What the hell are you saying?

25:56.805 --> 25:57.973
Say it so I can understand.

25:58.056 --> 26:00.058
Your dumbass wouldn't understand anyway.

26:00.934 --> 26:03.228
Tell me,
how do you think the narrator feels?

26:03.979 --> 26:04.813
Well?

26:05.438 --> 26:06.356
Thoughts?

26:07.440 --> 26:08.650
It's anxiousness.

26:11.444 --> 26:12.362
Anxious.

26:13.863 --> 26:16.366
"Even a rustling leaf comes to me."

26:22.330 --> 26:22.998
- Yeah!
- Yeah!

26:23.081 --> 26:25.458
You can't let it slide, for real.

26:25.542 --> 26:27.377
- Here's another one.
- Which one?!

26:27.460 --> 26:29.296
- I'm not gonna let it slide.
- This?

26:29.838 --> 26:30.839
Hey Hyung. You're here.

26:30.922 --> 26:31.923
- Hello.
- Hello.

26:32.007 --> 26:33.216
- Welcome.
- Hi.

26:33.717 --> 26:35.051
- Oh!
- Ooh.

26:35.844 --> 26:36.845
That's from Cheonan.

26:37.345 --> 26:38.179
The trip costs more.

26:38.305 --> 26:39.806
- Oh!
- I've been waiting for this.

26:39.889 --> 26:41.224
- Fentanyl.
- Hey, Hui-ju-ya,

26:41.308 --> 26:42.809
- That's a fuckin' lot.
- pay your share. You're the last one.

26:42.892 --> 26:44.102
- This party's gettin' good.
- Hey,

26:44.185 --> 26:45.186
pay him for his trip.

26:45.270 --> 26:46.271
- A hundred thousand's enough?
- This is yours too.

26:46.354 --> 26:46.938
- Yes.
- Huh?

26:47.439 --> 26:48.982
- Oh, yeah, thanks.
- Keep the rest.

26:49.733 --> 26:50.567
Here.

26:54.613 --> 26:55.447
Hyung.

26:56.323 --> 26:56.990
Count it.

26:59.242 --> 27:00.076
I trust ya.

27:01.911 --> 27:02.454
Hyung.

27:02.954 --> 27:03.705
Wait up.

27:04.289 --> 27:05.957
- I wanna ask something.
- We stocked up!

27:06.041 --> 27:06.708
Hey, Yeong-bin.

27:07.208 --> 27:08.293
Where are you going?

27:08.376 --> 27:10.629
- My tutor is coming.
- You gonna use those?

27:10.712 --> 27:11.713
Just go.

27:13.173 --> 27:14.049
Have fun.

27:14.132 --> 27:14.883
- Thanks man.
- You're leaving?

27:14.966 --> 27:15.675
You're reallly-

27:15.759 --> 27:16.718
- Thank you, thank you, thank you!
- Hey, hey.

27:16.801 --> 27:17.927
- See ya!
- Where you going?

27:18.011 --> 27:19.179
- Just let him go.
- Why's he such a try-hard?

27:19.262 --> 27:20.805
- Be safe!
- You don't know?

27:20.889 --> 27:22.349
That guy's always leaving.

27:22.432 --> 27:23.600
That's how he is.

28:12.732 --> 28:13.566
Hyung.

28:17.987 --> 28:19.906
Your mom came to our place the other day.

28:19.989 --> 28:21.533
She said you haven't been home.

28:22.534 --> 28:23.451
Get to the point.

28:25.704 --> 28:26.621
It's not that.

28:28.081 --> 28:29.249
It's about the fentanyl.

28:30.583 --> 28:32.085
What happens if you just stick it on

28:32.585 --> 28:33.795
somewhere on your neck.

28:36.339 --> 28:37.924
You won't feel it as strong.

28:38.967 --> 28:41.010
It's a painkiller, so you'll zone out.

28:42.637 --> 28:44.180
You'll get sluggish and sleepy.

28:44.889 --> 28:46.266
Some people might throw up.

28:47.726 --> 28:48.560
Why?

28:48.643 --> 28:49.477
Huh?

28:50.019 --> 28:50.937
Nothing.

28:51.020 --> 28:52.355
I was just curious.

28:55.942 --> 28:56.860
Yeong-bin-a.

28:57.485 --> 28:58.319
Hm?

28:59.112 --> 29:00.488
Don't screw around too much.

29:02.449 --> 29:04.617
You have nothing to worry about with me,
Hyung.

29:10.248 --> 29:11.082
Bye.

29:14.544 --> 29:16.713
That cheap-ass mother fucker.

29:30.602 --> 29:31.478
Hey, Ji-won.

29:31.561 --> 29:32.687
How have you been?

29:39.152 --> 29:42.238
Standard ninety-two point nine FM.
Your broadcasting station, JBS,

29:42.322 --> 29:45.408
would like to announce that
the time is now eleven pm.

29:45.492 --> 29:46.326
HLQA.

29:49.829 --> 29:51.956
Why don't you reach out
to your loved ones,

29:52.040 --> 29:54.918
and let them know that they
have done a great job today?

29:55.585 --> 29:56.419
Then we all…

30:06.846 --> 30:07.764
Wait a minute

30:10.225 --> 30:12.101
We usually only do dead drops.

30:13.645 --> 30:14.813
Next time we won't meet.

30:18.858 --> 30:19.567
Here.

30:19.818 --> 30:21.110
FENTANYL PATCH

30:21.986 --> 30:22.821
Hey.

30:23.363 --> 30:24.113
I said a girl.

30:28.451 --> 30:30.286
Shit. We almost got screwed.

30:32.622 --> 30:33.456
Move.

30:35.875 --> 30:36.709
What?

30:38.503 --> 30:39.337
You heard.

30:40.129 --> 30:40.922
You're in my way.

30:41.506 --> 30:43.424
Well fuck, man. Maybe you're in my way.

30:43.967 --> 30:44.759
You want to die?

30:46.094 --> 30:49.180
I don't like the way you're looking at me,
you little asshole.

30:54.477 --> 30:55.311
Hey.

30:56.563 --> 30:57.605
Stop staring.

31:00.358 --> 31:03.236
You better look away from me,
before I break your skull open,

31:03.319 --> 31:04.237
you fucker.

31:06.614 --> 31:07.574
Hey, Hyung.

31:09.033 --> 31:09.951
Go ahead.

31:18.918 --> 31:19.919
Watch who you mess with.

31:21.004 --> 31:22.380
You almost got stabbed.

31:24.841 --> 31:26.050
MOCK TEST IN ONE DAY

31:39.898 --> 31:41.149
Hey, 'sup.

31:49.908 --> 31:50.825
Hey, Beom-seok.

31:50.909 --> 31:52.035
The teacher wants you.

31:53.953 --> 31:54.621
Huh?

31:55.121 --> 31:56.414
Our teacher wants to see you.

32:14.766 --> 32:15.558
Here.

32:17.894 --> 32:18.811
Thanks, man.

32:28.863 --> 32:29.781
Oh, right.

32:30.448 --> 32:32.450
I heard you had a tough time at Mungang.

32:37.330 --> 32:38.998
I talked with Ji-won yesterday.

32:41.209 --> 32:42.043
Huh?

32:43.795 --> 32:46.130
I heard you got your ass
kicked almost every day.

32:46.631 --> 32:47.507
Good one.

32:50.718 --> 32:52.095
Is that why you transferred?

32:52.762 --> 32:53.805
Like a loser?

32:59.727 --> 33:00.603
I mean,

33:01.270 --> 33:03.231
I won't do anything like that to ya.

33:04.232 --> 33:05.566
I wanna be your friend.

33:08.987 --> 33:09.779
Sit down.

33:12.865 --> 33:13.700
Okay.

33:21.332 --> 33:22.250
Are you grateful?

33:26.170 --> 33:29.007
I'm going to be your friend and
I'm gonna keep your secret.

33:32.218 --> 33:33.177
Yeah, thank you.

33:33.928 --> 33:34.846
Thanks man.

33:35.888 --> 33:36.806
If you're grateful,

33:38.182 --> 33:39.517
do me a favor.

33:45.106 --> 33:45.982
What is it?

33:49.485 --> 33:50.445
Take it.

33:57.827 --> 34:00.455
You know the language section
takes more time, right?

34:01.039 --> 34:02.081
- Yes, ma'am.
- Yes.

34:02.165 --> 34:03.541
Use your time wisely.

34:04.167 --> 34:05.501
- Yes.
- Yes.

34:06.169 --> 34:07.295
And don't cheat.

34:07.962 --> 34:09.130
- Okay.
- Okay.

34:09.672 --> 34:10.673
All right.

34:59.055 --> 35:01.641
There was a bug that landed on your neck.

35:03.476 --> 35:04.185
Boys,

35:04.685 --> 35:05.686
what's going on?

35:06.562 --> 35:07.647
Face the front.

35:23.538 --> 35:25.248
It won't feel as strong.

35:25.331 --> 35:27.625
It's a painkiller, so you'll zone out.

35:27.708 --> 35:29.669
You'll get sluggish and sleepy.

35:30.461 --> 35:31.796
Some people might throw up.

35:41.764 --> 35:42.682
In literary expression,

35:42.765 --> 35:44.475
there's a method of
representing the object

35:44.559 --> 35:47.228
of expression by replacing it with
other related ideas or objects.

35:47.311 --> 35:49.647
This includes replacing the substance with
properties of the object or replacing

35:49.730 --> 35:52.108
the whole with a part of the object.

35:52.191 --> 35:55.194
These methods can be interchanged
with one another…

36:06.873 --> 36:07.498
Hey,

36:07.999 --> 36:09.208
where are you going?

37:22.156 --> 37:22.990
What?

37:32.166 --> 37:33.376
Why are you doing that?

37:33.459 --> 37:34.627
What's wrong?

37:48.182 --> 37:48.808
Hey,

37:49.308 --> 37:50.643
what is going on with you?

37:54.647 --> 37:55.231
Oh.

37:55.731 --> 37:56.857
Nothing.

38:00.528 --> 38:02.238
- I can't believe I got nothing right.
- Two

38:02.321 --> 38:02.905
Yes!

38:03.406 --> 38:04.490
- Five
- How many did you get wrong?

38:04.573 --> 38:05.157
What?

38:05.658 --> 38:06.325
- Three, three.
- Five.

38:06.826 --> 38:08.119
Integrated social studies.

38:12.540 --> 38:13.374
One,

38:14.583 --> 38:15.418
one,

38:16.294 --> 38:16.877
five,

38:17.378 --> 38:18.087
four,

38:18.796 --> 38:19.630
five,

38:20.423 --> 38:21.257
five,

38:22.091 --> 38:22.925
three,

38:24.218 --> 38:25.052
two.

38:26.595 --> 38:27.430
Five,

38:28.597 --> 38:29.432
four,

38:30.558 --> 38:31.392
three,

38:32.643 --> 38:33.477
one,

38:34.270 --> 38:35.521
- four.
- I can't hear him.

38:39.066 --> 38:39.900
Hey.

38:45.156 --> 38:45.781
What?

38:46.282 --> 38:47.366
What's going on?

38:47.450 --> 38:48.367
- What?
- What?

38:48.451 --> 38:49.285
Quiet.

39:02.089 --> 39:02.673
Si-eun,

39:03.174 --> 39:03.799
uh…

39:04.300 --> 39:05.760
it-it's not what you think.

39:28.949 --> 39:30.076
Newton's second law.

39:30.159 --> 39:32.453
Force is equal to mass times acceleration.

39:35.498 --> 39:39.377
The centrifugal force of an object can
be used to create a greater impact.

39:45.966 --> 39:46.884
Oh my god.

39:47.385 --> 39:48.886
You fucking lunatic!

39:56.602 --> 39:57.812
Wait, wait!

40:33.556 --> 40:34.890
I asked a favor.

40:36.892 --> 40:37.810
I said to stop.

40:48.946 --> 40:49.780
Oh.

40:50.781 --> 40:52.158
Let's not cross the line,

40:52.241 --> 40:52.867
hm?

40:53.367 --> 40:54.410
Enough is enough.

40:58.289 --> 40:59.248
You next?

40:59.331 --> 41:00.040
Me?

41:00.541 --> 41:02.918
Nah, you just woke up a guardian angel.

41:08.090 --> 41:08.924
Funny?

41:11.719 --> 41:12.595
Trying to be.

43:55.299 --> 43:57.051
ALL NAMES, PLACES, AND EVENTS SHOWN
ARE FICTIONAL

43:57.134 --> 43:59.178
ANY SIMILARITY TO REALITY IS COINCIDENTAL
